    "veld": "span",
    "grootste steunmoment: de plaat is getrokken": "largest support moment: the panel is in tension",
    "neutrale lijn, balk (n<sub>lijf</sub>, b<sub>ef,s</sub>)": "neutral axis, joist (n<sub>web</sub>, b<sub>ef,s</sub>)",
    "normaalspanning in de balk (druk)": "axial stress in the joist (compression)",
